1
00:00:00,697 --> 00:00:02,767
And also Bazinga.com
was taken.

2
00:00:04,368 --> 00:00:06,368
(Barry:)Anyway, thanks again.

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,100
(Barry:)Cooper, suck eggs.

4
00:00:10,541 --> 00:00:12,771
(Sheldon:)Since when do you help out
Barry Kripke?

5
00:00:12,776 --> 00:00:15,276
(Amy:)Well, I'd been thinking about
a cellular automata approach

6
00:00:15,279 --> 00:00:16,779
(Amy:)to neuronal connectivity,

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,610
(Amy:)and I thought it might have
some interesting applications

8
00:00:18,615 --> 00:00:20,185
(Amy:)to string theory--
it's not a big deal.

9
00:00:20,184 --> 00:00:22,084
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?

10
00:00:22,086 --> 00:00:24,756
(Sheldon:)When I was doing string theory
and hit a dead end,

11
00:00:24,755 --> 00:00:26,525
(Sheldon:)why didn't you try to help me?

12
00:00:26,523 --> 00:00:29,523
(Amy:)I did-- you said the only
math biologists know is

13
00:00:29,526 --> 00:00:31,696
(Amy:)if you have three frogs
and one hops away,

14
00:00:31,695 --> 00:00:33,925
(Amy:)that leaves two frogs.

15
00:00:33,931 --> 00:00:37,201
(Sheldon:)That's pretty funny,
that does sound like me.

16
00:00:37,201 --> 00:00:38,371
(Sheldon:)But that doesn't mean

17
00:00:38,368 --> 00:00:40,338
(Sheldon:)that you should be
standing on street corners

18
00:00:40,337 --> 00:00:43,637
(Sheldon:)handing out your math
to whatever guy comes along.

19
00:00:44,942 --> 00:00:46,612
(Amy:)Sheldon, we're all scientists.

20
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:48,280
(Amy:)I helped out
a fellow colleague.

21
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:49,608
(Amy:)You're being petty.

22
00:00:49,613 --> 00:00:51,213
(Sheldon:)I'm being petty?

23
00:00:51,215 --> 00:00:54,545
(Sheldon:)You know Barry and I
have a professional rivalry.

24
00:00:54,551 --> 00:00:56,721
(Sheldon:)You heard him--
he told me to suck eggs.

25
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,720
(Sheldon:)If we were friends,
he would have suggested

26
00:00:58,722 --> 00:01:00,192
(Sheldon:)I suck something
more pleasant.

27
00:01:03,293 --> 00:01:04,993
(Sheldon:)Why are you laughing?

28
00:01:04,995 --> 00:01:08,025
(Sheldon:)Did you learn
something?

